	// EXPECT-1: load_spikes_e2e_ms < 3340
	// HYPOTHESIS-2: Using QueueDepth specifically (not EffectiveLoad) for the quadratic penalty targets actual congestion more precisely since PendingRequests are transient
	// MECHANISM-2: QueueDepth reflects actual queued work while PendingRequests may double-count; quadratic on queue depth avoids over-penalizing instances with high pending but low actual queue
